{
  "id": "constancy",
  "term": "constancy",
  "definition": "Constancy, in this context, is the perceptual ability to experience an object’s surface color as stable even when the lighting changes and the light reaching the eye differs. This helps people keep a consistent sense of object color across many viewing conditions.",
